{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H5、H6支持靠尊严、秩序和克制维持的稳定需要持续用力，H7、H9、H10、H13及M22和原解释1也都支持快乐曾真实发生、正在过去的感觉及重新坚定时伴随的怀念与警觉。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"M1和原解释2说的是一个仍然需要的“回答”不能安顿全部，而修准把它改成“这份在乎”不能解决全部问题，改变了限制所指的对象，且“半音阶下行带来往后退的力量”也是所列依据中没有的新音乐成因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"M40只支持反复确认不能增加安全感、反而使他更注意到自己正在用力，原解释3只支持想留在亲切里及因感到它正在过去而急迫，并未确立他是为了留住熟悉感才用力确认这一动机。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"H1、H2支持没有现成解释可依靠和反复退回疑惑，H6及M1支持面对的力量或回答都有局限，但没有依据表明他越想弄清楚，疑问就越难结束，也没有明确说他持续主动追问解释。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4b933986-8f08-4dc1-be6b-e2a58094ee7c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133819459986Z", "elapsed_seconds": 282.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:43:01.470999+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "90b7384b7bbe9dbc928c6d82f3ee53b0e937ea2ad853340c910e3ef799bcb9a1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 